Modifications by huangserva (2026-09-25 to 2026-09-26), see CHANGES.md for the file list:
  - rewrote the sm_70 INT8 small-T decode attention kernel (key-split, 8 warps, PRMT dequant);
  - retuned the Volta flash prompt attention configuration;
  - added a two-GPU tensor-parallel target (src/targets/qwen3_6_27b_tp2), NCCL-in-graph and
    pinned-host-memory all-reduce, sharded LM/draft heads, half-width shape gates;
  - added the rank lockstep check, the front proxy/supervisor and the artifact sharding tool
    (src/runtime/engine/tp_lockstep.h, tools/tp2/).

Ideas referenced during development (no code copied):
  plus1998/NInfer-V100-Duo (two-GPU NInfer reference), ValerioDolci/ninfer-tp2 (pinned host
  memory mailbox), 1CatAI/1Cat-vLLM (Volta attention comparison).

